    <h1>Welcome to my game.</h1> 
    This is intended to be a more polished version of an old project i did for my programming class. I call this one,
    <h2>"Button Masher V2".</h2>

    <p>The objective is to just mash the button as many times as you can. You can either play the base game in it's original form as some sort of a solo experience, or you could try testing out the new multiplayer mode.</p>
    <h1>NOTE:</h1>
    <p>This is a work in progress and may contain bugs or incomplete features. Please report any issues you encounter to donaldgarcia580@gmail.com and I will work on them to the best of my ability.</p> 
    <h3>NOTE #2: I initially made this to work just for a controller, so you will need to get one if you haven't already.</h3>
